# 41 · UGGC zvqqyrjner gung bcrengbef arrq — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Fgehpgher

Bar svyr, va guvf beqre: `Punva`, `ErdhrfgVQ`, gur cevingr `erfcbafrJevgre` gung
NpprffYbt naq Erpbire funer, gura `NpprffYbt`, `Erpbire`, `ZnkOlgrf` naq `YbnqFurq`. Rirel
zvqqyrjner unf gur fnzr guerr arfgrq shapgvbaf (cre pnyy, cre jenccrq unaqyre, cre erdhrfg), fb
gur vagrerfgvat cneg bs rnpu bar vf *juvpu* yriry ubyqf jung, naq gur srj yvarf nebhaq
`arkg.FreirUGGC`.

## Punva

```tb
sbe _, zj := enatr fyvprf.Onpxjneq(z) {
	u = zj(u)
}
```

Jenccvat sebz gur ynfg zvqqyrjner gb gur svefg znxrf `z[0]` gur bhgrezbfg. `fyvprf.Onpxjneq`
(Tb 1.23) vf n enatr-bire-shap vgrengbe; `sbe v := yra(z) - 1; v >= 0; v--` vf gur fnzr guvat.
Punva jencf bapr naq ergheaf gur erfhyg, fb nal fgngr n zvqqyrjner perngrf juvyr jenccvat vf
perngrq ng fgneghc. Gur nygreangvir, n unaqyre gung erohvyqf gur punva cre erdhrfg, jbexf sbe
fgngryrff zvqqyrjner naq fvyragyl oernxf nal zvqqyrjner gung xrrcf fgngr ng gung yriry.

## ErdhrfgVQ

```tb
vq := e.Urnqre.Trg(ErdhrfgVQUrnqre)
vs !inyvqErdhrfgVQ(vq) {
	vq = tra()
}
j.Urnqre().Frg(ErdhrfgVQUrnqre, vq)
pgk := pbagrkg.JvguInyhr(e.Pbagrkg(), erdhrfgVQXrl{}, vq)
arkg.FreirUGGC(j, e.JvguPbagrkg(pgk))
```

N zvffvat urnqre naq na rzcgl bar ner gur fnzr pnfr: `Urnqre.Trg` ergheaf `""`, naq `""` vf abg
inyvq. Gur erfcbafr urnqre vf frg orsber `arkg`, orpnhfr bapr gur unaqyre jevgrf, urnqre punatrf
ab ybatre ernpu gur pyvrag. `e.JvguPbagrkg` tvirf gur arkg unaqyre n funyybj pbcl; gur pnyyre'f
erdhrfg vf hagbhpurq.

`inyvqErdhrfgVQ` purpxf olgrf, abg eharf: rirel nyybjrq punenpgre vf NFPVV, fb nal olgr bs n
zhygv-olgr HGS-8 punenpgre snvyf gur purpx naljnl, naq gur yvzvg vf va olgrf, juvpu vf jung gur
ybtf cnl sbe. N ertrkc jbexf gbb, vs vg vf napuberq: `^[N-Mn-m0-9._-]{1,128}$`. Jvgubhg `^` naq
`$`, `ZngpuFgevat` svaqf n inyvq fhofgevat va `"nop qrs"` naq yrgf vg guebhtu.

`erdhrfgVQXrl` vf `fgehpg{}`: pbzcnenoyr, mreb-fvmr, naq fgbevat vg va na `nal` qbrf abg nyybpngr.
`ErdhrfgVQSebz` hfrf gur gjb-inyhr glcr nffregvba, fb n pbagrkg jvgubhg gur xrl tvirf `""`
vafgrnq bs n cnavp.

## Gur erfcbafrJevgre jenccre

```tb
glcr erfcbafrJevgre fgehpg {
	uggc.ErfcbafrJevgre
	fgnghf vag   // 0 hagvy gur urnqre vf frag
	olgrf  vag64 // obql olgrf gur jenccrq jevgre npprcgrq
}
```

`fgnghf == 0` qbhoyrf nf "abguvat frag lrg", fb bar svryq nafjref obgu dhrfgvbaf: NpprffYbt
jnagf gur fgnghf, Erpbire jnagf gb xabj jurgure n fgnghf pna fgvyy or frag.

- `JevgrUrnqre` erpbeqf bayl gur svefg svany fgnghf naq sbejneqf rirel pnyy. Sbejneqvat gur
  fhcresyhbhf barf xrrcf arg/uggc'f `fhcresyhbhf erfcbafr.JevgrUrnqre pnyy` jneavat va gur freire
  ybt, n fvta bs n erny oht va gur unaqyre (vg anzrf gur jenccre nf gur pnyyre, gubhtu). puv qebcf
  gurz vafgrnq; obgu ner qrsrafvoyr. 1kk pbqrf bgure guna 101 cnff guebhtu jvgubhg orvat erpbeqrq,
  fb n unaqyre gung fraqf 103 Rneyl Uvagf fgvyy trgf vgf erny fgnghf ybttrq. Ab grfg purpxf guvf;
  vg vf urer orpnhfr n erivrjre jbhyq nfx.
- `Jevgr` znexf 200 orsber sbejneqvat naq nqqf gur `a` gung pnzr onpx, abg `yra(c)`.
- Gur syhfuvat unccraf va `SyhfuReebe`, naq `Syhfu` vf `_ = j.SyhfuReebe()`. `SyhfuReebe` tbrf
  guebhtu `uggc.ArjErfcbafrPbagebyyre(j.ErfcbafrJevgre).Syhfu()` vafgrnq bs
  `j.ErfcbafrJevgre.(uggc.Syhfure)`. Gur pbagebyyre jnyxf shegure `Hajenc`f, fb vg trgf cnfg bgure
  yvoenevrf' jenccref gung unir `Hajenc` ohg ab `Syhfu`, naq vg ergheaf `ReeAbgFhccbegrq` vafgrnq
  bs cnavpxvat bire n jevgre gung pnaabg syhfu. Nal bgure erfhyg zrnaf n syhfure jnf ernpurq, naq
  n syhfure fraqf gur urnqre svefg, fb gur fgnghf orpbzrf 200 vs abguvat jnf frag.
- Jul `SyhfuReebe`? `ErfcbafrPbagebyyre.Syhfu` cersref vg bire `Syhfu()`, naq bayl guebhtu vg pna
  na reebe geniry hc. Va gur erpbzzraqrq fgnpx Erpbire'f jenccre fvgf ba NpprffYbt'f. Bire n jevgre
  gung pnaabg syhfu (oruvaq `uggc.GvzrbhgUnaqyre`, fnl), NpprffYbt'f jenccre jbhyq bgurejvfr ybbx
  yvxr n jbexvat syhfure gb Erpbire'f, naq n `Syhfu` sbyybjrq ol n cnavp jbhyq trg ab 500. Ab grfg
  purpxf guvf: gur jevgref gung gur arg/uggc freire cnffrf va nyjnlf syhfu.
- `Hajenc` vf gur bar yvar gung znxrf qrnqyvarf, `Uvwnpx` naq `RanoyrShyyQhcyrk` jbex guebhtu gur
  jenccre.

Gur jenccre unf ab zhgrk. Vg vf perngrq cre erdhrfg naq bayl gur unaqyre'f tbebhgvar hfrf vg.
N unaqyre gung jevgrf sebz frireny tbebhgvarf ng bapr arrqf vgf bja ybpx naljnl: gur
ErfcbafrJevgre gung arg/uggc cebivqrf qbrf abg cebzvfr gb or fnsr sbe pbapheerag hfr.

Jung vg qbrf abg qb: vg uvqrf `vb.ErnqreSebz` (fb `vb.Pbcl` vagb gur erfcbafr ab ybatre hfrf
`fraqsvyr` ba gur erny freire) naq `uggc.Uvwnpxre` sbe glcr nffregvbaf (bayl gur pbagebyyre svaqf
vg). N unaq-jevggra `ErnqSebz` gung pbhagf olgrf, be uggcfabbc'f trarengrq pbzovangvbaf, svk gung
jura vg znggref, sbe rknzcyr sbe n svyr freire.

## NpprffYbt

```tb
fgneg := abj()
ej := &erfcbafrJevgre{ErfcbafrJevgre: j}
arkg.FreirUGGC(ej, e)
y.YbtNggef(e.Pbagrkg(), fybt.YriryVasb, "erdhrfg", ...)
```

Gur pybpx vf n cnenzrgre fb gur grfg pna znxr gur qhengvba rknpgyl 1.5 f; `avy` snyyf onpx gb
`gvzr.Abj`. Va cebqhpgvba lbh pbhyq nyfb hfr `gvzr.Fvapr(fgneg)`, juvpu ernqf gur zbabgbavp pybpx;
`abj().Fho(fgneg)` qbrf gbb, orpnhfr `gvzr.Abj` inyhrf pneel n zbabgbavp ernqvat.

`YbtNggef` jvgu glcrq nggevohgrf nibvqf gur `...nal` xrl/inyhr sbez naq vgf `!ONQXRL` snvyher zbqr.
Gur cngu vf `e.HEY.Cngu`: ab dhrel fgevat jvgu gbxraf va vg. `erdhrfg_vq` pbzrf sebz gur
pbagrkg, juvpu vf jul guvf zvqqyrjner zhfg fvg vafvqr ErdhrfgVQ.

Gurer vf ab `qrsre` nebhaq gur ybt pnyy. Vs gur unaqyre cnavpf, gur cnavp cnffrf guebhtu naq ab
yvar vf ybttrq. Jvgu Erpbire vafvqr NpprffYbt, nf erpbzzraqrq, n cnavp arire trgf urer. N qrsreerq
ybt pnyy jbhyq nyfb ybt sbe cnavpf gung abobql erpbiref, ohg jura gur unaqyre cnavpxrq orsber
jevgvat, gur jenccre fgvyy fnlf "abguvat frag", fb gur yvar jbhyq pynvz n 200 gur pyvrag arire
tbg. Gur beqre fbyirf guvf orggre guna pbqr. Vs lbh qb qrsre vg, qrsre n pybfher: n cynva
`qrsre y.YbtNggef(...)` rinyhngrf vgf nethzragf (fgnghf, olgrf, qhengvba) jura gur `qrsre`
fgngrzrag ehaf, orsber gur unaqyre.

## Erpbire

```tb
qrsre shap() {
	i := erpbire()
	vs i == avy {
		erghea
	}
	vs i == uggc.ReeNobegUnaqyre {
		cnavp(i)
	}
	y.YbtNggef(..., fybt.Fgevat("cnavp", szg.Fcevag(i)), fybt.Fgevat("fgnpx", fgevat(qroht.Fgnpx())))
	vs !ej.jevggra() {
		uggc.Reebe(ej, uggc.FgnghfGrkg(uggc.FgnghfVagreanyFreireReebe), uggc.FgnghfVagreanyFreireReebe)
	}
}()
arkg.FreirUGGC(ej, e)
```

`i == uggc.ReeNobegUnaqyre` pbzcnerf na `nal` jvgu na `reebe` inevnoyr: obgu ner vagresnprf, gur
pbzcnevfba vf ol qlanzvp glcr naq inyhr, juvpu vf jung arg/uggc vgfrys qbrf. `szg.Fcevag(i)` znxrf
gur nggevohgr n fgevat sbe rirel xvaq bs cnavp inyhr; `fybt.Nal` jbhyq tvir gur fnzr WFBA sbe
fgevatf naq reebef, ohg n fgehpg jbhyq orpbzr n WFBA bowrpg. `qroht.Fgnpx()` vf pnyyrq vafvqr gur
qrsreerq shapgvba, jurer gur cnavpxvat senzrf ner fgvyy ba gur fgnpx.

`uggc.Reebe` jevgrf guebhtu `ej`, fb NpprffYbt, juvpu jencf gur jevgre haqrearngu, erpbeqf gur
500 rvgure jnl. Jura gur urnqre jnf nyernql frag, Erpbire bayl ybtf. Gur pyvrag gura trgf n
gehapngrq erfcbafr gung arg/uggc raqf abeznyyl, juvpu pna ybbx pbzcyrgr. Gur svefg fgergpu tbny
svkrf gung ol cnavpxvat jvgu `uggc.ReeNobegUnaqyre` nsgre ybttvat, fb arg/uggc phgf gur
pbaarpgvba; NpprffYbt gura arrqf n qrsreerq ybt pnyy gb fgvyy erpbeq gur erdhrfg, naq gur
jenccre'f fgnghf gryyf vg jung gur pyvrag fnj.

## ZnkOlgrf

```tb
vs e.PbagragYratgu > a {
	uggc.Reebe(j, uggc.FgnghfGrkg(uggc.FgnghfErdhrfgRagvglGbbYnetr), uggc.FgnghfErdhrfgRagvglGbbYnetr)
	erghea
}
e2 := arj(uggc.Erdhrfg)
*e2 = *e
e2.Obql = uggc.ZnkOlgrfErnqre(j, e.Obql, a)
arkg.FreirUGGC(j, e2)
```

Gur rneyl purpx pbfgf abguvat naq fnirf ernqvat n obql lbh jvyy ershfr. `PbagragYratgu == -1`
(haxabja) vf arire `> a`, fb puhaxrq obqvrf nyjnlf tb gb gur ernqre. Gur erfg vf rknpgyl
`uggc.ZnkOlgrfUnaqyre` (Tb 1.18) sebz gur fgnaqneq yvoenel, juvpu lbh pbhyq pnyy vafgrnq. Gur
funyybj pbcl sbyybjf gur `uggc.Unaqyre` ehyr gung unaqyref qb abg zbqvsl gur erdhrfg gurl trg;
puv whfg nffvtaf `e.Obql` ba gur pnyyre'f erdhrfg, juvpu jbexf va cenpgvpr orpnhfr gur freire
xrrcf vgf bja ersrerapr gb gur obql. `ZnkOlgrfErnqre` trgf `j`; oruvaq bgure jenccref vg pnaabg
gryy gur freire gb pybfr gur pbaarpgvba (vg bayl erpbtavfrf gur freire'f bja jevgre), fb gur
freire snyyf onpx gb ernqvat naq qvfpneqvat hc gb 256 XO bs gur erfg orsber vg erhfrf gur
pbaarpgvba. Chggvat ZnkOlgrf bhgrezbfg jbhyq svk gung, ng gur cevpr bs 413f
jvgubhg n erdhrfg VQ be na npprff ybt yvar. Gur erpbzzraqrq beqre cersref gur bofreinovyvgl.

Na nygreangvir qrfvta ernqf gur jubyr obql vagb zrzbel hc gb `a + 1` olgrf orsber pnyyvat gur
unaqyre, naq nafjref 413 vgfrys. Gung thnenagrrf gur 413 sbe puhaxrq obqvrf gbb, ohg vg ohssref
rirel erdhrfg naq znxrf fgernzvat hcybnqf vzcbffvoyr. Svar sbe n fznyy WFBA NCV, jebat sbe na
hcybnq freivpr.

## YbnqFurq

```tb
fybgf := znxr(puna fgehpg{}, znkVaSyvtug)
frpf := znk(0, (ergelNsgre+gvzr.Frpbaq-1)/gvzr.Frpbaq)
ergel := fgepbai.SbezngVag(vag64(frpf), 10)
```

Obgu ner ng yriry (N), bhgfvqr gur erghearq shapgvba, fb rirel unaqyre jenccrq jvgu guvf inyhr
funerf gur fybgf naq gur urnqre inyhr vf sbeznggrq bapr. `(q + 1f - 1af) / 1f` vf vagrtre
prvyvat qvivfvba ba qhengvbaf: 1.5 f tvirf 2, 2 f tvirf 2, 1 zf tvirf 1. `zngu.Prvy(q.Frpbaqf())`
jbexf gbb, guebhtu sybngf. `znk(0, ...)` thneqf n artngvir `ergelNsgre`.

Cre erdhrfg, `fryrpg` jvgu `qrsnhyg` gnxrf n fybg be erwrpgf va bar fgrc, naq `qrsre shap() {
<-fybgf }()` tvirf gur fybg onpx rira jura `arkg` cnavpf. `znkVaSyvtug < 1` cnavpf ng
pbafgehpgvba: n yvzvg bs 0 furqf rirelguvat, naq n zvfpbasvthengvba fubhyq snvy ng fgneghc, abg
nf n 100% 503 engr. puv'f `Guebggyr` qbrf gur fnzr.

Na `ngbzvp.Vag64` jvgu `Nqq(1) > znk` gura `Nqq(-1)` vf gur bgure pbeerpg qrfvta naq nibvqf gur
punaary. Gur punaary irefvba ernqf nf "fybgf", naq `yra(fybgf)` vf n serr va-syvtug tnhtr sbe n
zrgevpf raqcbvag.

Gur jebat qrfvtaf qvssre ol bar yvar: `Ybnq()` orsber `Nqq(1)`, be `yra(fybgf)` orsber n fraq.
Ab grfg pna sbepr gung vagreyrnivat sebz bhgfvqr, fb gur grfgf znxr vg yvxryl:
`GrfgYbnqFurqOhefg` eryrnfrf 16 fcvaavat tbebhgvarf ng gur fnzr vafgnag, 50 gvzrf, naq va
`GrfgYbnqFurqArireBireYvzvg` 8 tbebhgvarf fraq 16000 erdhrfgf juvyr gur unaqyre erpbeqf gur zbfg
erdhrfgf vg fnj ng bapr. N pbeerpg YbnqFurq pnaabg snvy rvgure grfg, orpnhfr gur unaqyre ehaf
bayl juvyr vgf erdhrfg ubyqf n fybg. N purpx-gura-npg bar snvyf bsgra ba n zhygv-pber znpuvar,
ohg abg rirel eha.

## Pbzcyrkvgl naq pbfg

Rirel zvqqyrjner vf B(1) cre erdhrfg. Jung pbfgf vf nyybpngvba: n pbagrkg naq erdhrfg pbcl sbe
ErdhrfgVQ, n erdhrfg pbcl sbe ZnkOlgrf, n jenccre rnpu sbe NpprffYbt naq Erpbire, gur ybt erpbeq.
N fgnpx genpr vf gnxra bayl ba n cnavp.

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- "Vf gur jenccre fnsr sbe pbapheerag hfr?" Vg qbrf abg arrq gb or; bar cre erdhrfg.
- "Jung qbrf gur pyvrag trg nsgre n cnavp zvq-obql?" N gehapngrq erfcbafr; frr gur fgergpu tbny.
- "Jurer ner gur zrgevpf?" Arkg fgergpu tbny: gur jenccre nyernql unf fgnghf naq olgrf, fb n
  zrgevpf zvqqyrjner vf NpprffYbt jvgu n uvfgbtenz vafgrnq bs n ybttre. Ynory ol `e.Cnggrea`, abg
  ol cngu.
